   234	    - If the row is still invalid, the question is unresolved and goes to Alex.
   235	  - **Fewer than 2 decisive items is never asked again.** The question goes straight to unresolved, so a reader is never pressed to cite more.
   236	    More than 6, or a repeated id, is a shape error and is asked again.
