   465	  readers is disclosed.
   466	- **Signing:** agreed questions are confirmed by his one signature; disputed, invalid or unresolved questions need an explicit choice.
   467	- **The items-only brief** is written (`control-items-brief.md`) for review.
   468	- **The "always Yes" baseline is dropped,** for lack of a source. The baselines' sources are listed.
